= University of Massachusetts Chan Medical School - Prompt 06

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Systemic Inequity in Health Care
- Limit: 200 words
- Cycle used in this repo: 2024 archive on Admit.org
- Source: https://med.admit.org/secondary-essays/university-of-massachusetts-medical-school
